From 6596517ef4ca813a0066f410623787bac2209afa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Terrydaktal <9lewis9@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 05:31:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add causal GDN prefill reference and source-bound
 reproduction

Expose the raw-gate producer and token-ordered recurrence used to eliminate dependence of an earlier prefix on future gates and prefill partition boundaries. Preserve the existing unfused R4D M1 numerical target, including FP32 beta, normalization order and output rounding, and make empty chunks identity transitions.

Include the native partition/state probe, original source-bound builder and an isolated current-header compilation path with its successful receipt. Document input/output contracts, execution order, source hashes and the distinction between this R4D-M1 reference and the later stock-FLA compiled repair. Production dispatch is not changed by this experimental submission.

Validation: current-header HIP compilation passed without GPU execution and all copied source identities matched. The separately pinned reference passed 52 native comparisons, including future-gate interventions, nonzero state/history, strided gates and empty sequences. Current-header native integration is still unqualified.
Signed-off-by: Terrydaktal <9lewis9@gmail.com>
